### 1. GET - Menampilkan Seluruh Data Produk (Success)
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### 2. GET - Menampilkan Produk Berdasarkan ID (Success)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1

### 3. GET - Error 404 (ID Produk Tidak Ditemukan)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/9999

### 4. POST - Membuat Produk Baru (Success)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Buku Tulis Sinar Dunia",
  "price": 6000
}

### 5. POST - Kesalahan Validasi: Field Kosong (Error 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Penghapus"
}

### 6. POST - Kesalahan Validasi: Harga Bukan Angka (Error 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pensil 2B",
  "price": "gratis"
}

### 7. PUT - Mengupdate Data Produk (Success)
PUT http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Buku Tulis Sinar Dunia (Edisi Revisi)",
  "price": 7500
}

### 8. PUT - Error 404 (Produk Yang Ingin Diupdate Tidak Ada)
PUT http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 9999,
  "name": "Barang Misterius",
  "price": 50000
}


### 9. PUT - Kesalahan Validasi: ID Tidak Disertakan (Error 400)
PUT http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Produk Tanpa ID",
  "price": 10000
}

### 10. DELETE - Menghapus Data Berdasarkan ID (Success)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/1

### 11. DELETE - Error 404 (ID Yang Ingin Dihapus Tidak Ditemukan)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/9999
